hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1180","Hamein Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Man ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Ruzaiq ne hadith bayan ki, ke unhon ne Ali bin Abdullah bin Abbas ko dekha is haal mein ke woh chaukdi maar kar baithe hue the, apni ek taang dusri taang par rakhe hue the, dayin taang bayin taang par."
"1181","Hamein Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne hadith bayan ki, Imran bin Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Anas bin Malik ko dekha ke woh is tarah chaukdi maar kar baithe the aur apna ek qadam dusre qadam par rakhte the."
"1182","Hamein Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Wahb bin Jarir ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Qurrah bin Khalid ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Qurrah bin Musa al-Hujaimi ne hadith bayan ki, Sulaim bin Jabir al-Hujaimi se, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya jabke Aap ihtiba kiye hue ek chadar mein baithe the aur us ke kinare Aap ke qadmon par the, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah mujhe wasiyat kijiye, Aap ne farmaya: Allah se darne ko lazim pakdo aur neki mein se kisi cheez ko haqeer na samjho, agarche paani maangne wale ke bartan mein apne dol se paani undel dena ho, ya apne bhai se khile chehre ke saath baat karna ho, aur tahband latkane se bacho kyunke ye takabbur mein se hai aur Allah use pasand nahin karta, aur agar koi shakhs tumhein us cheez par aar dilaye jo woh tum mein jaanta hai to tum use us cheez par aar na dilao jo tum us mein jaante ho, use chhor do, us ka wabaal usi par hoga aur us ka ajar tumhare liye hoga, aur kisi cheez ko bura bhala na kaho, unhon ne kaha: pas main ne is ke baad na kisi chaupaye ko bura kaha aur na kisi insaan ko."
"1183","Hamein Ibrahim bin al-Munzir ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Hisham bin Sad ne hadith bayan ki, Nuaim bin al-Mujmir se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Hasan ko kabhi nahin dekha magar meri aankhein aansuon se bhar gayin, aur ye is liye ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek din bahar tashreef laye to mujhe masjid mein paaya, pas Aap ne mera haath pakad liya, to main Aap ke saath chal pada, Aap ne mujh se koi kalaam na kiya hatta ke hum Banu Qainuqa ke bazaar mein aaye, pas Aap ne us mein tawaf kiya aur dekha, phir Aap wapas hue aur main Aap ke saath tha, hatta ke hum masjid mein aaye, pas Aap baithe aur ihtiba kiya phir farmaya: Laka kahan hai, mere liye Laka ko bulao, to Hasan daudta hua aaya aur Aap ki god mein gir pada, phir us ne apna haath Aap ki dadhi mein daal diya, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apna munh khola aur apna munh us ke munh mein daal diya, phir farmaya: Ae Allah main is se mohabbat karta hun pas Tu is se mohabbat farma aur jo is se mohabbat kare us se mohabbat farma."
"1184","Hamein Yahya bin Salih ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ishaq bin Yahya al-Kalbi ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Zuhri ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Anas bin Malik ne hadith bayan ki, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhein Zuhar ki namaz parhayi, phir jab Aap ne salaam phera to minbar par khade hue aur Qayamat ka zikr kiya aur zikr kiya ke us mein bade bade muamlaat honge, phir farmaya: jo shakhs kisi cheez ke baare mein puchna chahe pas us ke baare mein puche, Allah ki qasam tum mujh se kisi cheez ke baare mein nahin puchoge magar main tumhein us ke baare mein bata dunga jab tak main apne is muqaam par hun, Anas ne kaha: pas log bahut roye jab unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ye suna, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam baar baar farmate rahe: pucho, to Umar apne ghutnon par gir pade aur kaha: hum Allah ke Rab hone par raazi hain aur Islam ke deen hone par aur Muhammad ke Rasool hone par, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam khaamosh ho gaye jab Umar ne ye kaha, phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: suno, aagah ho jao, qasam hai us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, mujh par Jannat aur Jahannam is deewar ke saamne pesh ki gayin jab main namaz parh raha tha, pas main ne aaj ki tarah khair aur sharr mein kuch nahin dekha."
"1185","Hamein Malik bin Ismail ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Uyayna ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: main ne Zuhri ko suna woh use Abbad bin Tamim se bayan kar rahe the, woh apne chacha se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: main ne use dekha, main ne Ibn Uyayna se kaha: kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko, unhon ne kaha: haan, chit lete hue, apni ek taang dusri taang par rakhe hue."
"1186","Hamein Ishaq bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah bin Jafar ne hadith bayan ki, Umm Bakr bint al-Miswar se, woh apne waalid se riwayat karti hain, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf ko dekha is haal mein ke woh chit lete hue the, apni ek taang dusri taang par uthaye hue."
"1187","Hamein Khalaf bin Musa bin Khalaf ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein mere waalid ne hadith bayan ki, Yahya bin Abi Kasir se, Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, Ibn Tikhfa al-Ghifari se, ke un ke waalid ne unhein khabar di ke woh Ashaab e Suffa mein se the, unhon ne kaha: ek dafa main masjid mein raat ke aakhri hisse mein soya hua tha, mere paas aane wala aaya jabke main pet ke bal soya hua tha, to us ne mujhe apne paon se harkat di aur kaha: utho, ye aisa letna hai jise Allah naapasand karta hai, pas main ne apna sar uthaya to dekha ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere sar par khade hain."
"1188","Hamein Mahmud ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yazid bin Harun ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Walid bin Jamil al-Kindi ne khabar di jo Filastin ke rehne walon mein se hain, Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Umama se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam masjid mein ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo apne chehre ke bal aundha pada hua tha, to Aap ne use apne paon se mara aur farmaya: utho, ye jahannamiyon jaisa sona hai."
"1189","Hamein Yahya bin Sulaiman ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Ibn Wahb ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Umar bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Qasim bin Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Umar ne hadith bayan ki, Salim se, woh apne waalid se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum mein se koi apne baayein haath se na khaye aur na apne baayein haath se piye, kyunke shaitaan apne baayein haath se khaata hai aur apne baayein haath se peeta hai, unhon ne kaha: Nafi is mein ye izaafa karte the: aur na us se le aur na us se de."
"1190","Hamein Qutaiba ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Safwan bin Isa ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah bin Harun ne hadith bayan ki, Ziyad bin Sad se, Ibn Nuhaik se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: sunnat mein se hai ke jab aadmi baithe to apne joote utaar de, phir unhein apne pehlu mein rakh de."
"1191","Hamein Abdullah bin Salih ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Muawiya ne hadith bayan ki, Azhar bin Said se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Umama ko kehte hue suna: shaitaan tum mein se kisi ke bistar par aata hai is ke baad ke us ke ghar wale use bichhaate aur durust karte hain, phir us par lakdi ya pathar ya koi cheez daal deta hai taake use us ke ghar walon par ghussa dilaye, phir jab woh ye paaye to apne ghar walon par ghussa na kare, unhon ne kaha: kyunke ye shaitaan ke kaam mein se hai."
"1192","Hum se Muhammad bin al-Muthanna ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Salim bin Nuh ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hamein Umar ne khabar di jo Bani Hanifa me se ek shakhs hai aur woh Ibn Jabir hai, unhon ne Wala bin Abdur Rahman bin Waththab se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Ali se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya jo shakhs aise ghar ki chhat par raat guzare jis par koi parda ya diwar na ho to us se zimma khatam ho gaya. Abu Abdullah ne kaha is ki sanad me nazar hai."
"1193","Hum se Muhammad bin Kathir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hamein Sufyan ne khabar di, unhon ne Imran bin Muslim bin Riyah al-Thaqafi se, unhon ne Ali bin Umara se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari tashreef laye to main unhein ek khuli chhat par upar le gaya jis ke ird gird diwar na thi, to woh neeche utar aaye aur farmaya qareeb tha ke main aaj raat is haal me raat guzarta ke mere liye koi zimma na rehta."
"1194","Hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Harith bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujh se Abu Imran ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Zuhair se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke Sahaba me se ek shakhs se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya jo shakhs mundair par raat guzare phir wahan se gir kar mar jaye to us se zimma khatam ho gaya, aur jo shakhs samandar me sawar ho jab woh josh me ho yani ughal raha ho phir halak ho jaye to us se zimma khatam ho gaya."
"1195","Hum se Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha mujh se Abdur Rahman bin Abi al-Zinad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha mere samne Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman ne gawahi di, unhein Abdur Rahman bin Nafi bin Abdul Harith al-Khuzai ne khabar di ke unhein Hazrat Abu Musa Ashari ne khabar di ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek bagh me kunwen ki mundair par tashreef farma the apni dono taangein kunwen me latkaye hue."
"1196","Hum se Muhammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hamein Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha hamein Muhammad bin Ibrahim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha mujh se Muslim bin Abi Maryam ne bayan kiya ke Hazrat Ibn Umar jab apne ghar se nikalte to kehte Ae Allah mujhe salamat rakh aur mujh se salamat rakh."
"1197","Hum se Muhammad bin al-Salt Abu Yala ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Hatim bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Husain bin Ata se, unhon ne Suhail bin Abi Salih se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya ke Aap jab apne ghar se nikalte to kehte Allah ke naam se, bharosa Allah par hai, gunah se bachne aur neki ki taqat Allah hi se hai."
"1198","Hum se Musa bin Ismail ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Yahya bin Abdur Rahman al-Asari ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Shihab bin Abbad al-Asari ne bayan kiya ke Abd al-Qais ke wafd me se baaz ne unhein zikr karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha jab hum ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf apne wafd ka safar shuru kiya to hum chale, yahan tak ke jab hum pahunchne ke qareeb hue to hamein ek shakhs mila jo apne oont par tez chala raha tha, pas us ne salam kiya to hum ne use jawab diya, phir woh ruk gaya aur kaha ye log kin me se hain, hum ne kaha Abd al-Qais ka wafd hai, us ne kaha tumhein khush aamdeed aur ahlan, tumhi ko main talash kar raha tha, main tumhein khushkhabri dene aaya hun, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne kal hum se farmaya, unhon ne mashriq ki taraf dekha phir farmaya kal is taraf se yani mashriq se Arab ka behtareen wafd zaroor aayega, to main raat bhar ghoomta raha yahan tak ke subah ho gayi, to main ne apni sawari par kas kar bandha aur safar me tez chala yahan tak ke din chadh aaya, aur main ne wapas lotne ka irada kar liya tha, phir tumhari sawariyon ke sar nazar aaye, phir us ne apni sawari ki lagam mod kar wapas lotte hue apne aane jaane ke raaste par tez chalate hue, yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tak pahuncha jabke Aap ke ird gird Muhajireen aur Ansar me se Aap ke Sahaba the, to us ne kaha mere maan baap Aap par qurban, main aap ko Abd al-Qais ke wafd ki khushkhabri dene aaya hun, to Aap ne farmaya Ae Umar tumhein un ka pata kaise chala, us ne kaha ye rahe mere peeche aa rahe hain qareeb aa gaye hain, phir us ne ye baat zikr ki, to Aap ne farmaya Allah tumhein bhalai ki khushkhabri de, aur log apni bethne ki jaghon me tayyar ho gaye, aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam bethe hue the, to Aap ne apni chadar ka kinara apne haath ke neeche rakh kar us par tek lagayi aur apni dono taangein phela lein, phir wafd aa gaya to Muhajireen aur Ansar un se khush hue, phir jab unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur Aap ke Sahaba ko dekha to khushi se apne oonton ko khush haal kiya aur jaldi se aage aaye, to logon ne jagah kushada kar di jabke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam isi tarah tek lagaye hue the, to Ashajj peeche reh gaya aur woh Munzir bin Aaidh bin Munzir bin Harith bin Numan bin Ziyad bin Asr hai, phir us ne un ki sawariyan jama keen phir unhein bithaya aur un ke bojh utare aur un ka saman jama kiya, phir us ne apna ek kapdon ka thela nikala aur safar ke kapde utar kar joda pehen liya, phir aahista aahista chalte hue aaya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya tumhara sardar aur rehnuma aur tumhare kaam ka zimmedar kaun hai, to un sab ne mil kar usi ki taraf ishara kiya, aur Aap ne farmaya kya ye tumhare sardaron ka beta hai, unhon ne kaha us ke baap dada jahiliyat me humare sardar the aur ye hamein Islam ki taraf lane wala hai, phir jab Ashajj pahuncha aur ek taraf bethne laga to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam seedhe ho kar beth gaye aur farmaya yahan aao Ae Ashajj, aur ye pehla din tha jab us din us ka naam Ashajj rakha gaya, use bachpan me jab woh doodh peeta tha gadhi ne apne khur se zakhmi kar diya tha, to us ke chehre par chand jaisa nishan tha, phir Aap ne use apne pehlu me bithaya aur us se narmi farmayi aur un par us ki fazilat ko pehchana, phir ye log Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf mutawajjeh hue Aap se sawal karte aur Aap unhein batate, yahan tak ke guftagu ke aakhir me Aap ne farmaya kya tumhare paas tumhare zade safar me se kuch hai, unhon ne kaha ji han, phir woh jaldi se uthe, un me se har shakhs apne saman ki taraf gaya aur hatheliyon me khajooron ke dher le aaye, phir woh Aap ke samne chamde ke dastarkhwan par rakhe gaye, aur Aap ke samne khajoor ki ek chhadi thi jo do haath se chhoti aur ek haath se badi thi, aur Aap use pakde rehte the kam hi us se juda hote the, phir Aap ne us se un khajooron ke ek dher ki taraf ishara karke farmaya kya tum is ko Tazuz kehte ho, unhon ne kaha ji han, Aap ne farmaya aur kya tum is ko Sarfan kehte ho, unhon ne kaha ji han, aur kya tum is ko Burni kehte ho, unhon ne kaha ji han, Aap ne farmaya ye tumhari khajooron me sab se behtar aur tumhare liye sab se nafa bakhsh hai, aur qabile ke baaz buzurgon ne kaha aur sab se zyada barkat wali, aur ye humare paas ek khajoor ka darakht tha hum use apne oonton aur gadhon ko khilate the, phir jab hum apne is wafd se wapas aaye to us me humari raghbat bahut badh gayi aur hum ne us ki qalam lagayi yahan tak ke humare phal usi se hone lage aur hum ne us me barkat dekhi."
"1199","Hum se Mualla ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Wuhaib ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Suhail bin Abi Salih ne bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab subah karte to kehte Ae Allah Teri madad se hum ne subah ki aur Teri madad se hum ne shaam ki aur Tere hukm se hum jeete hain aur Tere hukm se hum marte hain aur Teri hi taraf uth kar jana hai, aur jab shaam karte to kehte Ae Allah Teri madad se hum ne shaam ki aur Teri madad se hum ne subah ki aur Tere hukm se hum jeete hain aur Tere hukm se hum marte hain aur Teri hi taraf lotna hai."
"1200","Hum se Muhammad bin Salam ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Waki ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ubada bin Muslim al-Fazari se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha mujh se Jubair bin Abi Sulaiman bin Jubair bin Mutim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha main ne Hazrat Ibn Umar ko kehte hue suna Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab subah aur shaam karte to in kalimaat ko kabhi na chhodte Ae Allah be shak main Tujh se duniya aur aakhirat me aafiyat mangta hun, Ae Allah be shak main Tujh se apne deen aur duniya aur apne ghar walon aur maal me muafi aur aafiyat mangta hun, Ae Allah meri sharmgahon ko chhupa aur mere dar ko aman de, Ae Allah meri hifazat farma mere samne se aur mere peeche se aur mere dayein se aur mere bayein se aur mere upar se, aur main Teri azmat ki panah mangta hun is baat se ke main neeche se achanak halak kar diya jaun."
"1201","Hum se Ishaq ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Baqiyya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muslim bin Ziyad se jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Maimuna ke aazad karda ghulam hain riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha main ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya jo shakhs subah ke waqt kahe Ae Allah be shak hum ne subah ki hum Tujhe gawah banate hain aur Tere arsh uthane walon ko aur Tere farishton ko aur Teri tamam makhlooq ko gawah banate hain ke be shak Tu hi Allah hai Tere siwa koi mabood nahi Tu akela hai Tera koi shareek nahi aur be shak Muhammad Tere bande aur Tere Rasool hain, to Allah us din us ke chauthai wujood ko azaad kar dega, aur jo ise do martaba kahe Allah us ke aadhe wujood ko aag se azaad kar dega, aur jo ise chaar martaba kahe Allah use us din aag se poori tarah azaad kar dega."
"1202","Hum se Saeed bin al-Rabi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Shuba ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yala bin Ata se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha main ne Amr bin Asim ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha main ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna, unhon ne kaha Hazrat Abu Bakr ne arz kiya Ae Allah ke Rasool mujhe koi aisi cheez sikha dein jo main subah aur shaam kahun, Aap ne farmaya kaho Ae Allah ghaib aur hazir ke janne wale, aasmanon aur zameen ke paida karne wale, har cheez ke Rab aur Malik, main gawahi deta hun ke Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, main Teri panah mangta hun apne nafs ke shar se aur shaitan ke shar aur us ke shirk se, ise kaho jab tum subah karo aur jab shaam karo aur jab apna bistar pakdo."
"1203","Hum se Musaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha hum se Hushaim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Yala se, unhon ne Amr se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se isi tarah riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne kaha har cheez ke Rab aur Malik, aur unhon ne kaha shaitan ke shar aur us ke shirk se."
